  <dataqual>
    <attracc>
      <attraccr>Vegetation values are as reported by CRMS field crews (visual cover estimates on 4 m2 plots). Hydrologic summaries depend on recorder completeness; site-years with fewer than 90 valid growing-season days are left blank. NDVI is a 250 m, 16-day composite and mixes marsh, water and other cover within 1 km. Storm exposure is from best-track positions and wind radii, not modeled or measured site winds. Freeze temperature is from the nearest of five GHCN stations, up to 120 km away.</attraccr>
    </attracc>
    <logic>Each row is unique by site and year. Percent values are within 0-100 and proportions within 0-1. Missing values are empty fields. Checked by the pipeline before writing.</logic>
    <complete>341 sites; vegetation for all rows; salinity for 5686 rows, flooding for 4950, NDVI for 5728, salinity index for 6357. Swamp (forested) sites are excluded. A CRMS Floristic Quality Index could not be computed because the species coefficient of conservatism list was not available from a keyless source at build time.</complete>
    <posacc>
      <horizpa>
        <horizpar>Coordinates are the mean of the plot coordinates in the CPRA export; positional accuracy is not stated by the source.</horizpar>
      </horizpa>
    </posacc>
